    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3788" root="تحت" body-key="t">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحْتَانِىٌّ</span></b>  [<i>Of,</i> or <i>relating to, the location that
is beneath, below,</i> or <i>under; inferior; lower;</i>]
rel. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحْت</span>, like as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَوْقَانِىٌّ</span> is of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَوْق</span>: <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ا</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ن</span>
being very often added in the rel. n. (TA.)
[<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُحَيْت</span> dim. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحْت</span>, q. v.]

